# The package carries package.json, README.md, LICENSE, the icon, the bundle in dist/ and, in a
# platform's package (task package:all), that platform's spin CLI and its VERSION under
# bin/<target>/: everything else is how it is built and tested.
**
!package.json
!README.md
!LICENSE
!images/icon.png
!dist/extension.js
!bin/*/spin
!bin/*/VERSION
